00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A design brief turns “make it fast” into a measurable target with conditions and a way to verify it.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Hypothetical: “carry two occupants for 20 km” is clearer than “be practical”; add measurable conditions before design.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Requirement rewrite

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

